  {"date": "2021-09-01", "venue": "Shoreline Amphitheatre", "city": "Mountain View", "state": "CA", "gap": 10, "set": "2", "prev": "Piper", "in": ">", "next": "Twist", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2021-10-28", "venue": "MGM Grand Garden Arena", "city": "Las Vegas", "state": "NV", "gap": 13, "set": "1", "jamchart": true, "jam": "> from \"Strawberry Letter 23\". The first set-closing \"20YL\" doesn't disappoint. By 6:20, Trey has played the jam away from a typical jam from the song; this is lighter. Behind his deft playing and Fish's fantastic drumming, this jam truly takes off. By 10:30, the band is locked in, the prowess of their great jamming in Fall '21 on full display. Things get a bit swampy before Trey guides the band back into the song proper.", "prev": "Strawberry Letter 23", "in": ">", "xnext": "Seven Below", "nb": 1},
